# Experiment 5 — how much more does a looser cleanup actually rewrite?
#
# The cheapest of the five to answer honestly, because the answer is a number
# the pipeline already computes: churn_pct in each bundle's meta.json, the
# word-level distance from verbatim.md to cleaned.md. The report puts the two
# variants' churn side by side, and the word diff under "side by side" is the
# literal before/after on the same recording.
#
# There is no judge tier here on purpose: `ab.sh judge` is curator-side only and
# will refuse this experiment. Read the churn, read the diff, and decide for
# yourself whether it still sounds like you — nobody else can.
#
#   bin/ab.sh freeze          # once: fixtures from your own bundles
#   bin/ab.sh run cleanup-licence
STAGE=process
REPS=3
FIXTURES_SET=all
VARIANTS="baseline loose"
VARIANT_baseline_PROFILE=default
VARIANT_loose_PROFILE=cleanup-loose
